/E (From an economic perspective, rising living costs and financial uncertainty increase price sensitivity, even among ethically motivated consumers. Research indicates that engagement with sustainable products is strongly influenced by perceived affordability and financial stability, particularly among Millennials in the Netherlands \(Skordoulis et al., 2025\). )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
