/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (This gap is especially relevant for Carrots as a multi category marketplace serving consumers who are not necessarily vegan. For these audiences, ethical intent exists, but confusion and lack of clarity create friction at the moment of choice. In-depth and sense making content is also underused across the market. Practical guides, clear explanations of labels, and simple comparisons across categories could reduce uncertainty and build trust. Strengthening owned channels such as educational blog content and newsletters would support long term discovery beyond short term social visibility. This creates an opportunity for Carrots to own the role of a practical and non judgemental guide that helps non vegan consumers make confident everyday vegan choices across categories.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [17]
>>
